<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    5055    363     341    57</p>
<p> Great Lakes    20403   1406    1674    14</p>
<p> River Points   17348   1898    7195    17</p>
<p> Southwest	18423    351    1013    15</p>
<p> Gulf Points    21560   4766    3427    36</p>
<p> Plains Area    33857   5620	67    17</p>
<p> Pacific NW     10788    880     unq    39</p>
<p> Grand Total   127434  15284   13717    19</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
